{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"herb_bundle","model_identifier":"herb_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## herb_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -3.0..7.5, z -2.0..2.0 (size 4.0 x 10.5 x 4.0 u = 11 x 30 x 11 cm).\nHerb bundle: a fistful of green herbs (~28 cm) with small white and yellow flowers, stems tied with cord at the grip; leaves up (+Y). Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## herb_bundle\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -3.0..7.5, z -2.0..2.0 (size 4.0 x 10.5 x 4.0 u = 11 x 30 x 11 cm).\nHerb bundle: a fistful of green herbs (~28 cm) with small white and yellow flowers, stems tied with cord at the grip; leaves up (+Y). Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"stem_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.85,-3.0,-0.85],"to":[-0.35,6.0,-0.35],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,0,8.5,9.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[9,0,9.5,9.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10,0,10.5,9.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,0,11.5,9.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[2,14,2.5,14.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[3,14,3.5,14.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2ada4a11-f43b-5ae3-aae8-606c6ee95ad9"},{"name":"stem_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.35,-3.0,-0.